      "writtenOn": "2022-02-28T03:19:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems okay in a vacuum, but how does it interact with the goal of upstreaming the power sequencing subsystem? Support for named-gpios is limited to this codebase, so it doesn\u0027t seem like this is useful longer-term since we\u0027d eventually have to drop it.\n\nIf we want Zephyr code to use a GPIO, I think we should let it handle that exclusively and omit the GPIO definitions for the legacy code.",
      "revId": "34561043a8c33e62476195837b4c16f85e6eb403",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
