        "id": 1281040
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-28T04:35:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So this is certainly interim code, but maybe necessary especially since the named-gpios has special handling for RW ssyjump.\nAnd since it is all conditionally compiled, should not get in the way of upstreaming (can just strip these bits of code out).\nIt will make integrating with existing configs much easier (see the brya CL in the same series).",
      "parentUuid": "66a43686_633c6216",
      "revId": "34561043a8c33e62476195837b4c16f85e6eb403",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "139b05f0_f50a0056",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
