        "id": 1361259
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-28T04:50:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sysjump to RW doesn\u0027t normally happen while the AP is on though, right? It\u0027ll usually happen right after EC power-on, unless we\u0027re also trying to support EFS1.",
      "parentUuid": "f543ccb9_27c6b3f2",
      "revId": "34561043a8c33e62476195837b4c16f85e6eb403",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "474811a5_0e7a9d01",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
