        "id": 1281040
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-28T06:26:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It depends on the system, lazor starts the AP to do EC verification before sysjump.\nIt\u0027s quite possible that for Nissa, this won\u0027t be an issue - not sure, though.",
      "parentUuid": "139b05f0_f50a0056",
      "revId": "34561043a8c33e62476195837b4c16f85e6eb403",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b3109ef9_ffef93eb",
