      "writtenOn": "2022-03-02T23:12:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "From my experience, gpioget/gpioset are very useful tool during poweron and also in some debug, like TBT/USB4. It can help quickly to identify/rule out issues. If it\u0027 s possible, I would suggest to keep this; or at least provide alternatives, not just for power sequencing. powerindebug only display value, not enough. and it only has power signals",
      "parentUuid": "b3347bfc_7248122a",
      "revId": "34561043a8c33e62476195837b4c16f85e6eb403",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
